msgstr "LReLU"

msgctxt "AlgorithmicSettings|"
msgid "SiLU"
msgstr "SiLU"

msgctxt "AlgorithmicSettings|"
msgid "Mish"
msgstr "Mish"

msgctxt "AlgorithmicSettings|"
msgid "GeLU"
msgstr "GeLU"

msgctxt "AlgorithmicSettings|"
msgid ""
"Sets the activation function for the signal in each hidden layer. Available "
"options are:\n"
"- linear: *f(x) = x*\n"
"- Binary: *f(x) = 0 if x < 0, 1 if x > 0\n"
"- Logistic sigmoid: *f(x) = 1 / (1 + e^(-x))*\n"
"- Sine: *f(x) = sin(x)*\n"
"- Cosine: *f(x) = cos(x)*\n"
"- Inverse tangent: *f(x) = arctan(x)*\n"
"- Hyperbolic tangent: *f(x) = tanh(x)*\n"
"- ReLU: *f(x) =  0 if x < 0, x if x > 0*\n"
"- Softplus: *f(x) = log(1 + e^x)*\n"
"- Softsign: *f(x) = x / (abs(x) + 1)*\n"
"- ELU: *f(x) = e^x - 1 if x <= 0, x if x > 0*\n"
"- LReLU: *f(x) = 0.01 * x if x < 0, x if x > 0*\n"
"- SiLU: *f(x) = x / (1 + e^(-x))*\n"
"- Mish: *f(x) = x * tanh(log(1 + e^x))*\n"
"- Gaussian: *f(x) = e * (-x^2)*\n"
"- GeLU: *f(x) = 0.5 * x * (1 + tanh(sqrt(2 / pi) * (x + 0.044715 * x^3)))*"
msgstr ""
"Définit la fonction d'activation du signal dans chaque couche cachée. Les "
"options disponibles sont : - linéaire : *f(x) = x* - binaire : *f(x) = 0 si "
"x < 0, 1 si x > 0* - sigmoïde logistique : *f(x) = 1 / (1 + e^(-x))* - "
"sinus : *f(x) = sin(x)* - cosinus : *f(x) = cos(x)* - tangente inverse : "
"*f(x) = arctan(x)* - tangente hyperbolique : *f(x) = tanh(x)* - ReLU : *f(x) "
"= 0 si x < 0, x si x > 0* - Softplus : *f(x) = log(1 + e^x)* - Softsign : "
"*f(x) = x / (abs(x) + 1)* - ELU : *f(x) = e^x - 1 si x <= 0, x si x > 0* - "
"LReLU : *f(x) = 0.01 * x si x < 0, x si x > 0* - SiLU : *f(x) = x / (1 + e^(-"
"x))* - Mish : *f(x) = x * tanh(log(1 + e^x))* - gaussienne : *f(x) = e * (-"
"x^2)* - GeLU : *f(x) = 0.5 * x * (1 + tanh(sqrt(2 / pi) * (x + 0.044715 * "
"x^3)))*"

